MiCrédito Honduras is a mobile application designed to capture photos and manage information securely on the user’s device.

The app allows users to take photos directly from the application and stores them locally on the device for later use. No images or personal data are uploaded to external servers.

Key features:
• Capture photos initiated by the user
• Local storage only
• No background camera usage
• No data sharing with third parties

MiCrédito Honduras respects user privacy and operates fully offline.
